@"
# PawCare - Veterinary Clinic Patient Management Database

## Project

PawCareDB is a SQL Server database for managing veterinary clinic clients, pets, veterinarians, bookings, treatments, invoices, and booking audit history.

## Database Features

- Clients
- Pets
- Veterinarians
- Bookings
- Treatments
- Invoices
- Invoice items
- Booking audit trail
- Stored procedures
- Pet age function
- Reporting views
- Indexed view
- Audit trigger
- Automated tests

## Project Files

- schema.sql
- procedures.sql
- reporting.sql
- audit_trigger.sql
- seed.sql
- reports.sql
- tests/test_scheduling.sql
- tests/test_treatments.sql
- tests/test_reporting.sql

## Automated Tests

The tests use THROW 50900 for expected business-rule failures.

Run all tests with:

    sqlcmd -S localhost -d PawCareDB -E -b -i tests/run_all_tests.sql
"@ | Set-Content README.md -Encoding UTF8

git add README.md
git commit -m "Add PawCare project documentation"